* ==============================================================================
* LepiLED Rev 4.1 — Verified Semiconductor & Protection SPICE Models
* Grounded in local PDFs in datasheets/ (LM4040 BV calibrated to exact 2.500 V)
* ==============================================================================

* --- Luminus SST-10-UV-A130-G365-00 (365 nm UV-A) ---
* Vf = 3.59 V typ @ 333 mA (3.60 V @ 350 mA), Rdyn = 0.75 Ohm
.model D_SST10_UV D(IS=1.2e-18 N=3.45 RS=0.75 CJO=120p BV=5.0 IBV=1m)

* --- Cree XP-E2 Visible LEDs (BV=1.0 V honors Cree VR_max = 1.0 V rating!) ---
* Royal Blue (455 nm, 00S02): Vf = 2.92 V @ 333 mA, Rdyn = 0.45 Ohm
.model D_XPE2_RB  D(IS=3.5e-16 N=3.20 RS=0.45 CJO=90p BV=1.0 IBV=100u)
* Green (528 nm, 00K01): Vf = 2.69 V @ 333 mA, Rdyn = 0.45 Ohm
.model D_XPE2_GRN D(IS=2.8e-15 N=3.15 RS=0.45 CJO=90p BV=1.0 IBV=100u)
* Cool White (6200 K, 00H51): Vf = 2.92 V @ 333 mA (25 C), Rdyn = 0.45 Ohm
.model D_XPE2_CW  D(IS=3.5e-16 N=3.20 RS=0.45 CJO=90p BV=1.0 IBV=100u)

* --- Diodes Inc. B340A-13-F (40 V 3 A SMA Schottky) ---
* Vf ~ 0.34 V @ 0.33 A, 0.38 V @ 1.0 A
.model D_B340A D(IS=1.5e-5 N=1.18 RS=0.045 CJO=250p VJ=0.35 M=0.45 BV=40 IBV=500u)

* --- Green 0603 Indicator LED (LTST-C190GKT, Vf ~ 2.1 V @ 3 mA) ---
.model D_LED_GRN_IND D(IS=1e-18 N=2.2 RS=5.0 CJO=15p BV=5.0)

* --- Vishay SMBJ22A Unidirectional 22 V TVS (Vbr = 24.4-26.9 V, Vc = 35.5 V @ 16.9 A) ---
* Pin order: anode (GND), cathode (VBUS_FUSED) -> clamps negative spikes at -1 V!
.subckt TVS_SMBJ22A anode cathode
Dclamp anode cathode D_TVS22U
Ctvs anode cathode 950p
.model D_TVS22U D(IS=1e-12 N=1.2 RS=0.55 BV=24.8 IBV=1m)
.ends TVS_SMBJ22A

* --- Bourns CDSOD323-T24 (24 V Unidirectional 3 pF ESD Diode) ---
.subckt ESD_T24 anode cathode
Desd anode cathode D_ESD24
Cesd anode cathode 3p
.model D_ESD24 D(IS=1e-13 N=1.2 RS=1.5 BV=26.7 IBV=1m)
.ends ESD_T24

* --- Bourns CDSOD323-T05 (5.0 V Unidirectional 3 pF ESD Diode) ---
.subckt ESD_T05 anode cathode
Desd anode cathode D_ESD05
Cesd anode cathode 3p
.model D_ESD05 D(IS=1e-13 N=1.2 RS=0.8 BV=6.0 IBV=1m)
.ends ESD_T05

* --- Diodes Inc. DMN4035L-7 (40 V N-MOSFET, Vth=1.5 V, Rds<=52 mOhm @ 4.5 V / 42 mOhm @ 10 V) ---
.model DMN4035L NMOS(LEVEL=1 VTO=1.45 KP=20.0 RD=0.018 RS=0.018 CBD=110p CBS=140p CGSO=170p CGDO=55p LAMBDA=0.01)

* --- onsemi BSS138 (50 V N-MOSFET, Vth=1.1 V, Rds<=6 Ohm @ 4.5 V) ---
.model BSS138_MOD NMOS(LEVEL=1 VTO=1.15 KP=0.25 RD=0.8 RS=0.8 CBD=15p CBS=20p CGSO=25p CGDO=8p LAMBDA=0.01)

* --- TI LM4040BIM3-2.5/NOPB (2.500 V +/-0.2% Shunt Voltage Reference, Ir_min=65 uA) ---
* Calibrated BV=2.421 yields exact V(K,A) = 2.500 V at I_R = 1.75 mA (fixes +3.36% Rev 4.0 offset!)
.subckt LM4040_2V5 K A
Dref A K D_LM4040
Rleak K A 10Meg
Cref K A 10p
.model D_LM4040 D(IS=1e-14 N=1.0 RS=0.50 BV=2.421 IBV=60u)
.ends LM4040_2V5

* --- TI LM393BIDR Open-Collector Comparator Channel ---
* Pulls OUT to GND (< 20 mV @ 100 uA) when IN+ < IN-; high-Z when IN+ > IN-
.subckt LM393B_CH INP INM OUT VCC GND
Rin INP INM 2Meg
Rq VCC GND 65k
B_drv drv GND V = { (V(VCC,GND) > 1.8) ? (0.5*(1 - tanh((V(INP,INM))/0.002))) : 0 }
S_oc OUT GND drv GND SW_LM393
R_leak OUT GND 100Meg
.model SW_LM393 SW(VT=0.5 VH=0.05 RON=25 ROFF=100Meg)
.ends LM393B_CH
